{
  "name": "magpie-marvis",
  "version": "0.1.5",
  "description": "magpie / OpenCode provider plugin for Tencent Marvis: its DeepSeek V4 Pro, Kimi K2.5, Claude Opus/Sonnet 4.6, GPT-5.4 and Hunyuan models through the Marvis model gateway — no API key to paste, sign in with QQ or WeChat.",
